Zen-extensions — extension store for Zen Music and compatible apps

Providers included:
  * zen-qobuz-lossless — backed by the Zen Music qobuz-api instance
    (https://justfreefun.antideploy.app, project: Anattana-Labs/qobuz-api).
    Serves FLAC (up to 24-bit/192 kHz) and MP3 320 streams.
  * zen-ytmusic — YouTube Music metadata & audio streams via the public
    innertube endpoints (client identity matches the ZenMusic app).
  * zen-jiosaavn — JioSaavn web API; encrypted media URLs are decrypted
    with the standard web-player DES key (ECB, "38346591").
  * zen-spotify — Spotify metadata/search via the anonymous web-embed
    credential and public /embed pages. Metadata only; no streams.

All provider code in sources/ is original work for this repository.
